    rdfs:label "A1" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf mc2:VisiumCaptureAreaEnum ;
    skos:definition "Capture area A1, one of the four standard positions (A1, B1, C1, D1) on a 10x Genomics Visium slide; each capture area contains a grid of spatially barcoded spots used to capture mRNA from a mounted tissue section." .

