    owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/mc2-center/mc2-model/DataTierEnum#Anonymous> <https://w3id.org/mc2-center/mc2-model/DataTierEnum#Open> <https://w3id.org/mc2-center/mc2-model/DataTierEnum#Controlled> <https://w3id.org/mc2-center/mc2-model/DataTierEnum#Private> ) ;
