    owl:unionOf ( EDAM:data_3917 EDAM:data_3112 <https://w3id.org/mc2-center/mc2-model/NGSMatrixTypeEnum#Scaled%20Counts> <https://w3id.org/mc2-center/mc2-model/NGSMatrixTypeEnum#Batch%20Corrected%20Counts> ) ;
